ks published in 2021 have at least 10.8 citations each, the highest P90 in the chart.","Not yet cited: more than half of the works published 2026 have no citations so far. This is expected for recent works and is not a sign of low quality.","Mean versus median: the mean is above the median in 2 of 3 years, because a few highly cited works pull the average up. The widest gap is 2021: mean 5, median 3.5, top work 16. The median is the better guide to a typical work.","Recent years: works from 2024–2026 have had less than three years to be cited, so their values will rise.","Small base: the values for 2021–2026 are based on only 10–29 works (lighter box or hollow point), so read them with care.","Few works: 2020 has fewer than 10 works (2020: 6), too few for a band. Each of those works is drawn as a dot."]}}}